        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Britt Walford, David Pajo, Ben Daughtrey\n- Bands: Squirrel Bait, Maurice, Slint\n- Roles: guitarist, musician, multi-instrumentalist\n- Topics: punk, alternative rock\n\nFacts:\n- David Pajo was born on June 25, 1968.\n- David Pajo is an American alternative rock musician.\n- David Pajo is a multi-instrumentalist who plays guitar, bass guitar, banjo, and drums.\n- David Pajo is best known for his guitar work.\n- Britt Walford was a member of the punk band Squirrel Bait.\n- Britt Walford quit Squirrel Bait to play with future Slint guitarist David Pajo in the band Maurice.\n- Ben Daughtrey replaced Britt Walford in Squirrel Bait after Walford left the band.",
